verbo to be ( presente para o passado)

Im a teacher. -> I was a teacher.
you are my friend. -> you were my friend.
he is in a happy day -> he was in a happy day.
she is very cool. -> she was very cool.
it is a sunny day. -> it was a sunny day.
we are all friends here. -> we were all friends here.
they are a tall and proud people. -> they were a tall ande proud a people.
